{
  "title": "Configurando seu Servidor IPTV",
  "description": "Onde encontrar os dados no painel e como vincular ao Gestor.",
  "content": {
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-circle-info'></i> Conectando o Coração do Negócio</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>Para que o Gestor consiga criar testes e renovar seus clientes automaticamente, ele precisa estar vinculado ao seu servidor IPTV.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4 flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-key text-blue-500 text-xs'></i> Pegando a Chave no Painel IPTV</h4><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl'><ul class='space-y-3'><li class='flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-300'><i class='fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1 text-[10px]'></i> <span>Acesse seu painel de IPTV e vá no menu <strong class='text-white'>Revendas</strong>.</span></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-300'><i class='fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1 text-[10px]'></i> <span>Pesquise pelo seu próprio nome de usuário (o seu painel).</span></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-300'><i class='fas fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1 text-[10px]'></i> <span>Procure pela opção <strong class='text-blue-400'>API Key</strong>.</span></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-300'><i class='fas fa-copy text-blue-500 mt-1 text-[10px]'></i> <span>Clique em <strong class='text-white'>Gerar Chave</strong> (caso não tenha) e <strong class='text-emerald-400'>copie</strong> o código gerado.</span></li></ul></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4 flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-gears text-blue-500 text-xs'></i> Configurando no Gestor</h4><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-6 shadow-xl'><div class='space-y-4'><div class='flex items-center gap-3'><i class='fas fa-folder-open text-gray-500'></i><p class='text-sm text-gray-300'>No Gestor, acesse <strong class='text-white'>Menu -> Configurações -> aba Servidores</strong>.</p></div><div class='flex items-center gap-3'><i class='fas fa-plus-circle text-emerald-500'></i><p class='text-sm text-gray-300'>Clique em <strong class='text-white'>Adicionar Servidor</strong> e selecione a plataforma <strong class='text-blue-400 font-black'>NATV</strong>.</p></div></div><div class='bg-red-600/10 border border-red-600/20 p-5 rounded-2xl'><p class='text-red-400 font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-triangle-exclamation'></i> Atenção Máxima</p><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed'>No campo <strong class='text-white'>seu_token_pixbot</strong>, cole a chave que você copiou. <br><br><span class='text-red-500 font-black underline'>Deixe o campo USUÁRIO em BRANCO</span>. Isso é vital para que o sistema use o WhatsApp do cliente como login.</p></div></div></section></div>"
  }
}
